WEBVTT

00:00:11.583 --> 00:00:14.208
<i>I am waiting.</i>

00:00:14.208 --> 00:00:17.750
<i>I have been waiting</i>
<i>here all this time, just for him.</i>

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:22.792
<i>So that today, I can finally tell</i>
<i>him the secret in my little heart.</i>

00:00:27.625 --> 00:00:28.500
Did you wait?

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.667
No.

00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:33.333
I... you...

00:00:34.292 --> 00:00:36.500
I give my permission to
turn this episode of Excel Saga

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.667
into a heart-throbbing love comedy.

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:41.667
I love you.

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:44.250
Yes, that's it.

00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:59.625
<i>Sore wa ai ja nai</i>

00:00:59.625 --> 00:01:03.458
<i>Ai wa sore ja nai</i>

00:01:03.458 --> 00:01:11.417
<i>Aishite iru kedo aisarete wa inai</i>

00:01:11.417 --> 00:01:15.333
<i>Kesshite ai ja nai</i>

00:01:15.333 --> 00:01:19.333
<i>Ketsu wa ai ja nai</i>

00:01:19.333 --> 00:01:27.042
<i>Aisaretai keredo motometari wa shinai</i>

00:01:27.875 --> 00:01:31.792
<i>Kono mi sasagete inochi nagedashi</i>

00:01:31.792 --> 00:01:35.792
<i>Wakime mo furazu tada hitasura ni</i>

00:01:35.792 --> 00:01:39.625
<i>Damashite sukashite yokohairi</i>

00:01:39.625 --> 00:01:42.875
<i>Tanin o fumitaoshi keri o kamashite</i>

00:01:42.875 --> 00:01:45.083
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:47.000
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.875
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:50.792
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>

00:01:50.792 --> 00:01:55.583
<i>Banana no kawa de korondemo</i>

00:01:55.583 --> 00:01:58.917
<i>Sore wa subete ano kata no tame</i>

00:01:58.917 --> 00:02:03.333
<i>Shiite iu nara sore wa kitto</i>

00:02:03.333 --> 00:02:11.167
<i>Ai to iu na no chuuseishin</i>

00:02:39.583 --> 00:02:42.000
"Lovey-Dovey Puny Love - Love Puny"

00:02:44.792 --> 00:02:48.458
Brother! Come on, Brother!

00:02:48.458 --> 00:02:52.000
Wake up, Brother!
You're going to be late for school!

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.750
You oversleep every single morning.

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:58.750
You really can't do anything without
Excel around, can you? I'm mad!

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:02.250
Five more minutes...

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:06.042
If you don't get up soon,
Excel's gonna be late too.

00:03:06.042 --> 00:03:09.042
I'm going to skip today.
You go by yourself.

00:03:09.042 --> 00:03:10.792
I can't let you do that.

00:03:10.792 --> 00:03:14.125
Yesterday, your homeroom
teacher told me to bring you in,

00:03:14.125 --> 00:03:16.125
no matter what I had to do!

00:03:16.125 --> 00:03:19.417
If you don't show up, you're going
to have to take a million tests!

00:03:19.417 --> 00:03:22.250
What?! That's bad!

00:03:27.375 --> 00:03:30.500
You're finally awake.
It's just like Mother said.

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:33.292
You wake up right away when
I mention something about tests.

00:03:33.292 --> 00:03:34.667
Giggle, giggle.

00:03:34.667 --> 00:03:36.792
Then, you mean it was a lie?

00:03:36.792 --> 00:03:39.917
Teehee. Actually, it was.

00:03:39.917 --> 00:03:41.667
Why, you little!

00:03:42.667 --> 00:03:46.042
Damn, Excel. She's really pushing it.
This is where I have to take a stand and...

00:03:46.042 --> 00:03:48.583
"1) Hit her  2) Scold her  3) Kill her"

00:03:48.583 --> 00:03:50.583
I've got to take a stand and kill her!

00:03:51.333 --> 00:03:53.083
What?! But...

00:03:53.083 --> 00:03:54.625
Brother, you're awful!

00:04:02.917 --> 00:04:05.250
Hail, Ilpalazzo!

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:07.208
Excel has returned!

00:04:07.208 --> 00:04:09.792
All for the sake of ACROSS,
the ideological secret organization,

00:04:09.792 --> 00:04:13.042
which aims to conquer the city,
and for Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:04:13.042 --> 00:04:15.750
At one time, I was a captive in a
prisoner camp deep in the jungles.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.042
I suffered hardships.

00:04:17.042 --> 00:04:18.750
There was a weird iron
masked old-man-beauty

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:20.542
and a psychedelic man with an afro.

00:04:20.542 --> 00:04:22.458
Fake tanks and choppers exploding.

00:04:22.458 --> 00:04:25.792
And bullet-crisscrossing
shootouts went bang, bang!

00:04:25.792 --> 00:04:28.125
Well, in conclusion, it was pretty close by...

00:04:28.125 --> 00:04:30.625
Good morning, Lord Ilpalazzo.

00:04:30.625 --> 00:04:31.292
--Long lines of dialogue are hard!

00:04:31.292 --> 00:04:33.208
--Good morning, Hyatt.
--Are you listening? Lord Ilpalazzo?

00:04:33.208 --> 00:04:36.208
It seems that you have executed
your mission without mishap.

00:04:36.208 --> 00:04:40.083
Many coincidences
happened to come together.

00:04:40.083 --> 00:04:41.917
You are very modest.

00:04:41.917 --> 00:04:44.250
And this lady over here is...

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.583
Oh?

00:04:46.917 --> 00:04:49.750
Oh, sorry, I hadn't
explained to you yet.

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:53.875
She is the member that had
gone missing. Her name is Excel.

00:04:53.875 --> 00:04:55.375
Oh, my.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:59.958
I hadn't the slightest
idea that you were my senior.

00:04:59.958 --> 00:05:02.917
It is a little late for a greeting,
but my name is Hyatt.

00:05:02.917 --> 00:05:05.125
Oh, nice to meet--

00:05:06.917 --> 00:05:08.458
What is with this situation?!

00:05:08.458 --> 00:05:11.250
Must I feel excited with you?!
No, that's not what I meant!

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:13.083
I mean, my name is Excel,
so great to meet you!

00:05:13.083 --> 00:05:14.917
But you don't seem that great!
You're kinda dead!

00:05:14.917 --> 00:05:15.750
You're dead!

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:17.875
Stuff's comin' out!
Stuff's comin' out! From your mouth!

00:05:17.875 --> 00:05:20.125
Oh, man! Aiya!
It's gushin' out! It's gushin'!

00:05:20.125 --> 00:05:22.375
The red stuff's overflowin'!

00:05:23.458 --> 00:05:23.833
Oh, Mr. Pe!

00:05:23.833 --> 00:05:25.500
"Farewell"
Oh, Mr. Pe!

00:05:30.625 --> 00:05:32.042
This is...

00:05:32.042 --> 00:05:34.125
I'm so glad, you're awake.

00:05:34.125 --> 00:05:35.625
I'm just a mountain girl.

00:05:35.625 --> 00:05:38.750
My name is Kumikumi.
Here's some warm soup.

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:41.125
"Continue", is it?

00:05:45.917 --> 00:05:47.417
Tetsuko...

00:05:48.667 --> 00:05:50.667
Come now,
the soup will get cold.

00:05:50.667 --> 00:05:52.667
Yeah, thank--

00:05:55.625 --> 00:05:57.125
Wait! The soup!

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:05.000
My savings are starting to dry up.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.958
I'd better find a job
somewhere soon, or else.

00:06:07.958 --> 00:06:11.333
But there's no way I'll find
a stable job in this recession.

00:06:11.667 --> 00:06:14.042
"Hehehe..."

00:06:14.833 --> 00:06:17.833
What's with you guys?
What's so funny?

00:06:19.167 --> 00:06:21.625
Stop it! Stay away!

00:06:21.625 --> 00:06:23.083
Stop, please!

00:06:23.083 --> 00:06:25.333
This isn't any fun
for me, damn it!

00:06:25.333 --> 00:06:29.333
Stop, you guys!
Let go of me! Stop!

00:06:34.125 --> 00:06:39.625
That's my classmate, Hyatt.
Hey, Hyatt, want to walk home together?

00:06:39.625 --> 00:06:45.000
I'm sorry, Ilpala. I don't want my
friends spreading rumors about me, so...

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.958
She's tough. All right then...

00:06:46.958 --> 00:06:48.667
"1) Stalk her  2) See her off  3) Put it in"

00:06:48.667 --> 00:06:50.042
"1) Stalk her  2) See her off"

00:06:53.125 --> 00:06:55.000
Damn them.

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:58.208
They're trying to laugh off a
hopeless situation.

00:06:58.208 --> 00:06:59.708
I'm...

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:03.750
You're the girl from yesterday.

00:07:12.708 --> 00:07:14.208
B-Beautiful...

00:07:14.292 --> 00:07:15.250
"1) Touch  2) Kiss  3) Put it in"

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.917
What am I doing?!

00:07:23.917 --> 00:07:25.500
You can't do that! You!

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:29.250
If you see someone lying on the
ground, you should help them!

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:30.583
Okay...

00:07:31.542 --> 00:07:32.875
Don't touch what's mine!

00:07:32.875 --> 00:07:34.167
Ow!

00:07:34.167 --> 00:07:37.083
Hey! Are you okay?! Hey!

00:07:37.083 --> 00:07:40.500
A breeze in a flower garden...

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:41.542
Are you awake?

00:07:41.542 --> 00:07:46.208
I'm sorry, I'm a little anemic.

00:07:46.208 --> 00:07:48.958
I'd like to go somewhere cool.

00:07:48.958 --> 00:07:51.583
S-Sure. Here, lean on me.

00:08:00.542 --> 00:08:01.583
"It's amazin'..."

00:08:01.583 --> 00:08:04.750
Oh-ho, so it was amazing?

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:05.708
"I saw it..."

00:08:05.708 --> 00:08:08.750
Oh-ho, so you saw it?

00:08:10.125 --> 00:08:13.083
"Hah hah hah..."

00:08:13.083 --> 00:08:15.458
"Keep off the grass!"
"Mayor"

00:08:22.875 --> 00:08:25.333
You're awake now?
I bought you a can of juice.

00:08:25.333 --> 00:08:27.208
Thank you very much.

00:08:27.958 --> 00:08:32.375
Oh, it feels so good.

00:08:32.375 --> 00:08:34.708
I-I'm glad.

00:08:34.708 --> 00:08:37.708
It feels so good!

00:08:38.292 --> 00:08:39.917
No, no! Wrong!

00:08:39.917 --> 00:08:42.792
How can I ever repay you?

00:08:42.792 --> 00:08:45.125
Oh, don't worry about that.

00:08:45.125 --> 00:08:47.542
Of course,
I'd help someone in trouble.

00:08:47.542 --> 00:08:48.500
My back...

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.208
Oh, no! I dropped my wallet!

00:08:50.208 --> 00:08:52.333
My baby's been kidnapped!

00:08:52.333 --> 00:08:55.000
Shut up! Be in trouble quietly!

00:08:58.292 --> 00:09:01.375
I guess encounters like
this do happen.

00:09:15.708 --> 00:09:19.833
Hatchan's so late. I'm tired
of eating bread crusts already.

00:09:19.833 --> 00:09:21.167
Oh, could it be that...

00:09:21.167 --> 00:09:23.083
"Excel's Wild Imagination"

00:09:23.667 --> 00:09:26.250
Hail, Ilpalazzo!

00:09:27.083 --> 00:09:28.833
While Excel is not here,

00:09:28.833 --> 00:09:31.542
I would like to announce the
newest personnel assignments.

00:09:32.292 --> 00:09:35.542
First, staff officer and
high-ranking member, Hyatt.

00:09:35.542 --> 00:09:38.083
And combatant Menchi.

00:09:38.083 --> 00:09:40.042
Toilet cleaner, Excel.

00:09:41.042 --> 00:09:43.875
Now, Hyatt, let us
go to a separate room

00:09:43.875 --> 00:09:46.833
for a detailed and beautifully
indecent meeting.

00:09:46.833 --> 00:09:51.375
It may get late, so bring your
own change of underwear.

00:09:51.375 --> 00:09:54.875
I thought that might be the case,
so I came prepared.

00:09:54.875 --> 00:09:58.250
You even brought a bath kit.
You certainly are very prepared.

00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:00.542
Truly my staff officer and
high-ranking member.

00:10:00.542 --> 00:10:02.042
I am not worthy.

00:10:02.042 --> 00:10:02.917
Come.

00:10:02.917 --> 00:10:03.333
"Excel's Wild Imagination"

00:10:03.333 --> 00:10:06.458
What?!
Something's not right here!

00:10:06.458 --> 00:10:09.125
I mean, please don't
abandon me, Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:10:09.125 --> 00:10:12.958
I idolize you so much! Why do
you treat me like I don't matter?!

00:10:12.958 --> 00:10:15.875
Didn't our encounter mean anything?!

00:10:20.875 --> 00:10:23.542
Brother, let's go home together.

00:10:23.625 --> 00:10:23.958
"1) Go home  2) Ignore  3) Put it in"

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:26.833
"1) Go home  2) Ignore  3) Put it in"

00:10:26.833 --> 00:10:28.667
Go home by yourself, stupid!

00:10:28.667 --> 00:10:31.083
What? Why?

00:10:31.083 --> 00:10:32.917
Oh, wait for me, Brother!

00:10:32.917 --> 00:10:34.500
Brother!

00:10:38.667 --> 00:10:41.125
Why did I have such
a realistic wild daydream?

00:10:41.125 --> 00:10:45.333
And why Hatchan? I'm supposed to
have more screen time than her.

00:10:45.333 --> 00:10:47.708
Oh, Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:10:47.708 --> 00:10:50.292
Please, please don't abandon me!

00:10:50.292 --> 00:10:52.792
I love you so much!
So much! Much, much!

00:10:52.792 --> 00:10:56.125
If it's for you, Lord Ilpalazzo,
I don't care what happens to me!

00:10:56.125 --> 00:10:57.792
Oh, Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:10:57.792 --> 00:10:59.625
Mmm, Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:10:59.625 --> 00:11:01.792
Ilpala, Ilpala, pala, palala!

00:11:01.792 --> 00:11:04.333
Beloved, darling, fragrant!

00:11:04.333 --> 00:11:07.583
Ilpala, Ilpala, pappala, pala!
Zzo, zzo, zzo, zzo, zzo!

00:11:19.708 --> 00:11:21.083
"Continue"
"Quit Already"

00:11:28.125 --> 00:11:30.958
Where shall we go, Ilpala?

00:11:30.958 --> 00:11:34.292
This is special, so I'll
pick a place that she'll like.

00:11:34.292 --> 00:11:36.583
"1) Amusement Park  2) Department Store
3) Graveyard"

00:11:36.875 --> 00:11:38.375
This is perfect.

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.792
We're at the department store!

00:11:40.792 --> 00:11:43.833
And, we'll take a
break at a coffee shop!

00:11:44.875 --> 00:11:47.792
This place is probably
nice and cool for you, right?

00:11:47.792 --> 00:11:51.250
Yes, it is quite comfortable, er...

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:54.333
I'm Watanabe.
Watanabe for short would be fine.

00:11:54.333 --> 00:11:58.792
Mr. Watanabe, then? I am H--

00:11:58.792 --> 00:11:59.958
H--

00:12:01.583 --> 00:12:05.167
No, ah, Ayasugi is my name.

00:12:05.167 --> 00:12:07.000
Miss Ah-Ayasugi, is it?

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:08.792
No, not like that.

00:12:08.792 --> 00:12:12.917
Miss Ah-Ayasugi-No-Not-Like-That?

00:12:12.917 --> 00:12:15.500
Please call me whatever you wish.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:18.500
Then I guess it'll be
Miss Ayasugi for short.

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:20.042
Something like that.

00:12:20.042 --> 00:12:21.708
Miss Ayasugi...

00:12:21.708 --> 00:12:26.375
But I'm so glad someone
like you moved in next door.

00:12:26.375 --> 00:12:29.167
The bastard who lived
next door before was so noisy!

00:12:29.167 --> 00:12:31.708
I wanted to storm in there
and yell at her so many times!

00:12:31.708 --> 00:12:33.708
Before?

00:12:33.708 --> 00:12:36.042
<i>Something to talk about,</i>
<i>something to talk about...</i>

00:12:36.042 --> 00:12:38.458
Oh, do you work, Miss Ayasugi?

00:12:38.458 --> 00:12:41.208
Yes, I was hired just yesterday,

00:12:41.208 --> 00:12:43.708
and I have no idea how
everything works,

00:12:43.708 --> 00:12:45.708
but I have a wonderful
senior coworker too,

00:12:45.708 --> 00:12:48.042
so I intend to
do the best that I can.

00:12:48.042 --> 00:12:50.042
Lucky you, I'm just...

00:12:50.042 --> 00:12:52.708
Mr. Watanabe, where do you work?

00:12:52.708 --> 00:12:54.500
What?! Oh, no, well...

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:57.333
You work at What-Oh-No-Well?

00:12:57.333 --> 00:12:59.042
Well, you see...

00:12:59.042 --> 00:13:02.417
You work at a
place called Well-You-See?

00:13:02.417 --> 00:13:04.792
You see...

00:13:04.792 --> 00:13:08.208
Where do you work, Mr. Watanabe?

00:13:08.208 --> 00:13:10.000
You see... You see...

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.000
"1) Tell a lie  2) Tell the truth  3) Put it in"

00:13:14.458 --> 00:13:18.250
Me? I'm a civil servant!

00:13:18.583 --> 00:13:19.667
"Public Service"

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:23.625
Hey, he's a civil servant!

00:13:23.625 --> 00:13:26.083
That's so wonderful!

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:29.417
So you're a local
government employee?

00:13:29.417 --> 00:13:33.750
You have such a very stable job.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:35.625
T-T-That's right.

00:13:35.625 --> 00:13:39.583
After all, the state pays my salary.

00:13:42.833 --> 00:13:44.333
A bug?

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:50.333
Idiot!

00:13:56.292 --> 00:13:59.042
Boss, those customers still won't leave.

00:13:59.042 --> 00:14:01.583
I didn't think they'd stick around
so long on one cup of coffee.

00:14:01.583 --> 00:14:03.500
They're still better than some.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:06.250
Those customers over there
haven't even ordered anything.

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:08.000
Go get their order, please.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:10.000
No way, no how, Sir.

00:14:11.792 --> 00:14:15.375
Well, if you have any troubles,
just let me know.

00:14:15.375 --> 00:14:17.125
I-I'll help you out.

00:14:17.125 --> 00:14:19.583
Thank you very much.

00:14:19.583 --> 00:14:20.958
That's good to know.

00:14:20.958 --> 00:14:22.667
"No kiddin'"

00:14:27.542 --> 00:14:29.833
Hey, Hatchan!

00:14:29.833 --> 00:14:31.750
Where have you gone, Hatchan?!

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:33.458
Come on, Hatchan!

00:14:33.458 --> 00:14:35.125
Oh, damn it!

00:14:35.125 --> 00:14:37.500
Everyone, has anyone seen Hatchan?

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:39.375
Please help me out!

00:14:39.375 --> 00:14:42.125
We're the ideological
organization, ACROSS!

00:14:42.125 --> 00:14:44.042
We're aiming to conquer the city!

00:14:44.042 --> 00:14:45.708
Has anyone seen Hatchan?!

00:14:46.375 --> 00:14:49.333
What an uncooperative
general population.

00:14:49.333 --> 00:14:52.000
In the end, the corrupt masses

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:54.167
need ACROSS's helping hand

00:14:54.167 --> 00:14:57.042
to give them guidance!

00:15:00.625 --> 00:15:04.708
No, finding our
missing member comes first.

00:15:04.708 --> 00:15:08.500
As Excel, a member of ACROSS,
the ideological organization,

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:11.667
now is not the time to be refueling.

00:15:11.667 --> 00:15:13.042
Here you go.

00:15:13.042 --> 00:15:14.333
I'll have some after all!

00:15:14.333 --> 00:15:15.875
Yum! Yum, yum!

00:15:15.875 --> 00:15:18.250
It's fine! It's totally okay
with me, even if it's half raw!

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:26.917
♪ We go to the department
store to go shopping. ♪

00:15:28.333 --> 00:15:29.667
Raw caviar.

00:15:29.667 --> 00:15:30.958
Roasted salmon roe.

00:15:31.958 --> 00:15:33.625
Good of you to come.

00:15:33.625 --> 00:15:36.000
I know it's sudden, but I have
a job for you right away,

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:38.292
the number one skilled
man in Shimabara.

00:15:39.083 --> 00:15:40.708
I want you to
give the package here

00:15:40.708 --> 00:15:43.875
to a blond woman that
is in this town.

00:15:43.875 --> 00:15:45.042
And the pay?

00:15:45.042 --> 00:15:46.583
As much as you want.

00:15:46.583 --> 00:15:48.083
How extravagant.

00:15:48.083 --> 00:15:51.125
Then I'll tell you a choice
piece of information in return.

00:15:51.125 --> 00:15:53.500
That man is still alive.

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:55.542
That man? You don't mean...

00:15:55.542 --> 00:15:56.583
That's right.

00:15:56.583 --> 00:16:00.667
I need him alive,
at least until my job's done.

00:16:00.667 --> 00:16:02.083
Nabeshin...

00:16:02.208 --> 00:16:04.250
I'll be back!

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:06.167
Please! The soup!

00:16:06.167 --> 00:16:07.583
Quickly!

00:16:07.583 --> 00:16:10.250
