you out of consideration for you.

00:16:43.958 --> 00:16:46.125
If you're going to be considerate,
then don't follow us!

00:16:46.125 --> 00:16:47.417
Is it fun to ruin my breathtaking

00:16:47.417 --> 00:16:49.125
and emotional
great lovey-dovey plan?!

00:16:49.125 --> 00:16:50.417
On top of that, she isn't well!

00:16:50.417 --> 00:16:51.750
Don't you want to let her rest?!

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:52.958
Don't you want to be kind to her?!

00:16:52.958 --> 00:16:54.625
Don't you want to gently put
your arm around her shoulders?!

00:16:54.625 --> 00:16:55.625
--And, and, and... And!

00:16:55.625 --> 00:16:57.292
--Mr. Watanabe...
--And, and, and... And!

00:16:57.292 --> 00:17:00.000
What is that thing for?

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.792
It's to ride on. It's free if
you don't put money in it though.

00:17:02.792 --> 00:17:04.542
Didn't you ride those
when you were a brat?

00:17:04.542 --> 00:17:05.667
It doesn't matter!

00:17:05.667 --> 00:17:07.250
Miss Ayasugi isn't
interested in things like that,

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:08.333
so she doesn't need to know!

00:17:08.333 --> 00:17:09.375
"Look!"

00:17:09.667 --> 00:17:14.667
How wonderful! I have never
ridden anything like that before!

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:18.083
W-Want to ride it, since
we're taking a break anyway?

00:17:18.083 --> 00:17:19.458
"So, you're gonna ride it after all..."

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:22.750
"Adults, please do
not get on these rides"

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:26.042
This piston motion brings back memories.

00:17:26.042 --> 00:17:28.667
Miss Ayasugi,
this isn't making you feel sick, is it?

00:17:28.667 --> 00:17:30.917
It feels very nice.

00:17:30.917 --> 00:17:34.875
Man, what a weird girl. Getting so
happy over something like that.

00:17:34.875 --> 00:17:35.875
Shut up!

00:17:35.875 --> 00:17:39.667
It's wonderful that she can
enjoy everything so innocently!

00:17:39.667 --> 00:17:43.083
I want to make Miss Ayasugi happy!
Those are my pure intentions!

00:17:43.083 --> 00:17:44.917
She's a weak girl!

00:17:44.917 --> 00:17:47.333
It's only natural that
I should take care of her!

00:17:47.333 --> 00:17:49.833
That's true,
she does seem rather weak.

00:17:49.833 --> 00:17:51.417
"It's too late..."

00:17:52.333 --> 00:17:53.792
Miss Ayasugi!

00:17:54.333 --> 00:17:55.833
Toilet, toilet...

00:17:55.833 --> 00:17:58.458
Nothing good comes from eating
too much, even if they were samples.

00:17:58.458 --> 00:17:59.375
What's this?

00:17:59.375 --> 00:18:03.708
W-Well, er, I've always loved you.

00:18:03.708 --> 00:18:05.583
Please accept this!

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:09.750
Thank you.

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:13.375
No, well... Please excuse me!

00:18:14.625 --> 00:18:16.875
Was that about right?

00:18:19.625 --> 00:18:22.083
It hurts, Mr. Ilpala.

00:18:22.083 --> 00:18:25.667
I... need... that box...

00:18:26.292 --> 00:18:28.750
"1) Take her home  2) Go to a hospital
3) Put it in"

00:18:34.583 --> 00:18:36.167
What should I do?

00:18:36.167 --> 00:18:38.000
What should I do?!

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:40.750
But why are these problems
cropping up one after another?!

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:43.333
Maybe there's someone messing
around with my destiny?!

00:18:43.333 --> 00:18:44.708
"Destiny"

00:18:44.708 --> 00:18:46.083
Knock it off!

00:18:46.083 --> 00:18:48.917
Damn, that hurt!
You made me bleed!

00:18:48.917 --> 00:18:51.042
Shut up! Shut up and die!

00:18:51.042 --> 00:18:53.708
M-Mr. Watanabe...

00:18:53.708 --> 00:18:56.583
Please, to the toilet...

00:18:56.583 --> 00:19:00.125
I will enjoy seeing the
power of the new type of bomb.

00:19:01.125 --> 00:19:02.792
I'm sorry...

00:19:04.083 --> 00:19:05.208
You're!

00:19:05.208 --> 00:19:08.208
You bastard! That's why Tetsuko was...

00:19:08.208 --> 00:19:10.333
Nabeshin,
when in the world did you...

00:19:10.333 --> 00:19:12.083
I'll tickle you!

00:19:12.083 --> 00:19:14.208
Don't! Stop!

00:19:16.667 --> 00:19:19.125
It's so refreshing when you
get out what you gotta get out.

00:19:19.125 --> 00:19:20.292
Oh, Senior.

00:19:20.292 --> 00:19:21.750
Hey, Hatchan!

00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:23.417
Why are you here?

00:19:23.417 --> 00:19:26.750
Look! I got something seemingly
nice at the department store!

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:29.833
Fork over an offering to ACROSS!

00:19:29.833 --> 00:19:32.208
I have received it! Kinda like that.

00:19:32.208 --> 00:19:33.708
How splendid.

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:38.792
What? It sorta looks like a bomb!

00:19:38.792 --> 00:19:41.000
Hatchan, this is no time to be dead!

00:19:42.292 --> 00:19:46.417
How could this be?
A bomb in a dating game?

00:19:46.417 --> 00:19:48.167
Ilpala?

00:19:48.167 --> 00:19:51.625
If you love me, the bomb...

00:19:51.625 --> 00:19:52.958
the bomb...

00:19:52.958 --> 00:19:54.458
All right!

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:59.458
Tetsuko, I've avenged you.

00:19:59.458 --> 00:20:01.333
It's too late!

00:20:01.333 --> 00:20:04.583
It's the end, even for you.

00:20:04.583 --> 00:20:06.375
