00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:15.000
"Maybe she's constipated..."

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:17.250
W-Which one could it be?

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:22.083
As a rule, if I cut one of
these three, we'll be saved.

00:20:22.083 --> 00:20:25.083
If I make a mistake, it'll be ka-boom!

00:20:26.208 --> 00:20:29.500
What you can see with
your eyes is not all that there is.

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:32.042
Open the eye of your soul!

00:20:32.042 --> 00:20:33.375
The eye of my soul?!

00:20:33.375 --> 00:20:36.167
Who the heck is
this mysterious old man?

00:20:36.167 --> 00:20:38.958
In any case, which wire?!

00:20:38.958 --> 00:20:41.125
It's the red one! Just a hunch!

00:20:41.125 --> 00:20:42.208
"Red  Blue  Green"

00:20:44.208 --> 00:20:45.583
I did it.

00:20:46.542 --> 00:20:49.417
I thought you,
of all people, would save me.

00:20:49.417 --> 00:20:51.000
I trusted you.

00:20:57.625 --> 00:21:01.875
Wow, thank you, Papa!
I always wanted one of these!

00:21:01.875 --> 00:21:04.917
Oh, you spoil him so much, Dear!

00:21:05.917 --> 00:21:09.375
I'll buy you anything that you want.

00:21:09.375 --> 00:21:11.458
I want a kid brother!

00:21:11.458 --> 00:21:15.208
All right, Papa will
work hard at it! Right, Dear?

00:21:15.208 --> 00:21:16.875
Oh, you!

00:21:18.542 --> 00:21:19.417
--What's wrong?!

00:21:19.417 --> 00:21:20.375
--Mama!
--What's wrong?!

00:21:20.375 --> 00:21:22.458
You aren't...

00:21:22.458 --> 00:21:24.250
It looks like it.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:26.667
Be happy, Sandora,
you'll have a kid brother!

00:21:26.667 --> 00:21:28.167
Yay! All right!

00:21:28.167 --> 00:21:31.125
Why?! The numbers don't add up!

00:21:31.125 --> 00:21:33.875
Even when she was with me,
my wife and Gomez were...

00:21:33.875 --> 00:21:36.875
No!

00:21:39.167 --> 00:21:40.583
A mere...

00:21:40.583 --> 00:21:44.292
A mere program made
by the ignorant masses.

00:21:44.292 --> 00:21:45.792
However...

00:21:47.875 --> 00:21:50.917
Continue. To do it over again.

00:21:51.792 --> 00:21:54.750
Let us return everything to
the way it was before,

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:56.250
with my great powers.

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:58.250
Here we are!

00:21:59.167 --> 00:22:04.042
"Episode 4: Love Puny"

00:22:04.042 --> 00:22:05.667
"Episode 4: Love Puny"
"Today's Experiment..."

00:22:05.667 --> 00:22:07.458
"Episode 4: Love Puny"
"Today's Experiment... Failed"

00:22:09.375 --> 00:22:11.500
Here I come, civil service exam!

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:14.083
I am going to do this!

00:22:17.375 --> 00:22:20.750
Mr. Watanabe, wasn't it?

00:22:20.750 --> 00:22:22.750
