00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:14.833
<i>Tender and soft</i>

00:23:14.833 --> 00:23:23.625
<i>That my body is to your taste</i>

00:23:24.583 --> 00:23:32.375
<i>To your hunger-stricken eyes</i>

00:23:32.375 --> 00:23:40.250
<i>How does my body seem</i>

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:48.125
<i>If you are to eat me, do it in one blow</i>

00:23:48.125 --> 00:23:56.875
<i>So that the meat does not get hard</i>

00:23:59.708 --> 00:24:00.708
Say, say, Director?

00:24:00.708 --> 00:24:01.875
What is it, Excel?

00:24:01.875 --> 00:24:03.875
Are we going to be okay? Are we?

00:24:03.875 --> 00:24:04.708
Is what going to be okay?

00:24:04.708 --> 00:24:07.083
Well, sort of like the
way we're doing things

00:24:07.083 --> 00:24:09.917
and should we just keep
doing things the same way?

00:24:09.917 --> 00:24:11.250
Are you worried?

00:24:11.250 --> 00:24:14.083
Just a bit.
I believe in you, Director,

00:24:14.083 --> 00:24:16.042
but, but, how should I say it?
How should I say it?

00:24:16.042 --> 00:24:17.042
What is it?

00:24:17.042 --> 00:24:18.125
No, it's okay.

00:24:18.125 --> 00:24:20.625
Next time on Quack
Experimental Anime, Excel Saga:

00:24:20.625 --> 00:24:24.000
Episode 5: "The Interesting
Giant Tower"! It is! It is!

00:24:24.000 --> 00:24:25.917
Is it interesting?!
Is it interesting?!

00:24:25.917 --> 00:24:28.594
